Package: bgbcalc
Type: Package
Title: Calculations for German Civil Code Rules ('BGB-Rechenregeln')
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Dimitrios", "Geromichalos", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "riskdatascience@web.de", comment = "Dr."),
    person("RiskDataScience GmbH", role = c("aut", "cph")))
Description: Numerical and calendar calculations for provisions of the German
    Civil Code ('Buergerliches Gesetzbuch', BGB)
    <https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/bgb/>. Covers time limits ('Fristen'),
    interest ('Zinsen'), monetary limits ('Betragsgrenzen'), proportional
    allocations ('Quoten') and inheritance calculations ('Erbrecht'). German
    parameter names preserve statutory terminology ('deutsche Rechtsbegriffe').
    Results include exact fractions ('Brueche'), calculation steps
    ('Rechenschritte'), assumptions ('Annahmen') and a fixed source identifier
    ('Quellenfassung'). Legal conditions require qualified inputs. Conditional
    models require justified method choices ('Methodenwahl'); universal legal
    completeness is not asserted ('keine umfassende Rechtsentscheidung').
